Comment: 0,0:12:15.59,0:12:21.68,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Comment: 0,0:12:23.10,0:12:28.69,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.53,0:01:36.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This G-Fighter is made up entirely\Nof the new Gundam parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.03,0:01:38.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've had Ms. Sayla piloting it...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.37,0:01:40.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...and we've had no technical problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.48,0:01:43.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we separate the G-Fighter\Nand insert Gundam in between...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.94,0:01:45.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...we get the G-Armor...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.84,0:01:48.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...which is a combination of the Gundam\Nwith all the new parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.72,0:01:52.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The problem is, we haven't been able\Nto test a mid-air docking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.31,0:01:54.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Sayla isn't used to it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.20,0:01:56.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.52,0:01:58.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.02,0:02:03.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But there's no problem separating\Nthe parts from the Gundam in mid-air.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.00,0:02:10.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At this speed, I think we'll be able\Nto do it even during battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.41,0:02:12.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The laser sensor alignment\Nneeds to be refined.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.54,0:02:15.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I gotta go to the toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.31,0:02:17.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Make it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.12,0:02:17.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.64,0:02:21.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our main problems with its usage\Nare in these following areas...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.95,0:02:26.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The G-Sky is formed by adding the G-Parts'\Nrear engine to the Core Fighter...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.44,0:02:29.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...so it can be used as\Na long-range fighter-bomber.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.70,0:02:31.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it uses the bottom half of the Gundam...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.85,0:02:35.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...so while the G-Sky's in action,\Nthe Gundam is disabled.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.23,0:02:37.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So we'd mostly use the\NEasy form of the G-Sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.47,0:02:42.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It can use any Core Fighter from\Nthe Guncannon or Guntank.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.21,0:02:45.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's gotta be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.21,0:02:49.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's dock the G-Bull into the G-Armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.43,0:02:57.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These shields, right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.38,0:03:01.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The main goal of these new parts\Nis to strengthen the Gundam's armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.50,0:03:04.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if you think about the moment\Nwhen it converts into the Gundam...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.93,0:03:06.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...you have to remove the shields.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.97,0:03:11.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So what we need to do is develop\Na joint to link the two shields together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.12,0:03:15.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And we'll also need at least twice\Nas many supply parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.16,0:03:18.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, we'll be unable to make\Nthe best use of our one Gundam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.33,0:03:22.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like they'll live on this ship\Nfor the rest of their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.98,0:03:43.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.17,0:03:46.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll have them work on technical\Nimprovements as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.78,0:03:51.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When the White Base's\Nengine maintenance is complete...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.14,0:03:53.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...you will head to Federation \Nheadquarters in South America.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.98,0:03:56.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will return to the frontlines\Nin Europe. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.26,0:03:59.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All rise! Salute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.46,0:04:01.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I pray for your success.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.20,0:04:04.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And... give my regards\Nto those three little ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.22,0:04:08.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Mr. Shiden is going to leave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.49,0:04:09.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where is he gonna go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.69,0:04:11.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How should any of us know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.57,0:04:24.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think he really is leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.73,0:04:26.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah... I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.99,0:04:31.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Repair it quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.08,0:04:32.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.31,0:04:33.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ask the Colonel!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.00,0:04:34.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.02,0:04:34.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kai...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.62,0:04:36.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kai...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.42,0:04:38.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.42,0:04:43.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's inevitable. All those military formalities\Njust don't suit me at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.20,0:04:44.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.34,0:04:47.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't say I like everything about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.24,0:04:51.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But we're comrades,\Nwho have been through so much together!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.60,0:04:54.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I like the way you put that, Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.02,0:04:55.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.88,0:04:57.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M-Mr. Kai!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.17,0:04:58.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let him do as he likes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.88,0:05:00.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.17,0:05:01.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mr. Bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.55,0:05:04.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you push yourself too much,\Nyou can't win battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.28,0:05:05.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And that's why I've decided to quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.51,0:05:09.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Zeons are pushing themselves hard, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.18,0:05:11.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess I've just gone past my limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.14,0:05:27.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kai!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.43,0:05:30.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please take this along with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.37,0:05:32.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should be able to sell it for some cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.21,0:05:35.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that's your toolbox, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.10,0:05:37.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll need money, no matter where you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.98,0:05:39.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.76,0:05:44.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't say I like everything about you either.\NBut, I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.72,0:05:46.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you feel that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.83,0:05:49.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been a pleasure. Thanks for everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.87,0:05:52.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you really going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.52,0:05:54.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Stay alive, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.38,0:06:02.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You also think he's a coward,\Ndon't you, Mirai?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.89,0:06:09.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The second ship is carrying a Z'Gok...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.22,0:06:11.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...an amphibious heavy mobile suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.52,0:06:15.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're extremely reliable.\NBut this ship only has one Gogg.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.56,0:06:17.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good. Have them stop \Nthe Trojan Horse from leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.82,0:06:21.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Before the Trojan Horse leaves the dock,\NI want to know where it's heading.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.11,0:06:24.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir! I've already got someone working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.29,0:06:37.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Think I should start a hardware store?\NEh, Amuro?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.34,0:06:38.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Soldier!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.25,0:06:40.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.13,0:06:43.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You look like you've been\Nthrown off the warship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.97,0:06:46.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.14,0:06:49.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't have a place to stay, do you?\NCome stay at my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.39,0:06:53.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean it?\NSo there must be a catch, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.06,0:06:54.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.39,0:06:56.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't mind if it's only for a couple of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.77,0:06:58.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My name's Miharu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.77,0:07:01.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I live with my little brother and sister.\NYou don't mind, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.19,0:07:05.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So the three of you are hiding\Nin an abandoned house?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.78,0:07:07.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.58,0:07:17.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.92,0:07:19.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.21,0:07:20.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Were you good?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.50,0:07:21.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.30,0:07:24.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay. He's gonna be our guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.42,0:07:27.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, how do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.81,0:07:41.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,About the warship you were on...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.82,0:07:42.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.78,0:07:43.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's quite something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.86,0:07:45.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess so. You like ships?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.95,0:07:47.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, growing up by the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.32,0:07:51.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, even though the White Base is a ship,\Nit's technically more of a space warship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.45,0:07:54.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see. It's a spaceship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.95,0:07:56.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.58,0:07:59.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,, What?.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.25,0:08:02.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just worrying about nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.34,0:08:05.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're probably tired.\NRest for a while, I'll go get you a blanket.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.38,0:08:06.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.30,0:08:08.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Make yourself at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.81,0:08:14.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They seem well trained.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.68,0:08:18.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen. If he leaves the house,\Nyou let me know right away, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.69,0:08:19.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.15,0:08:20.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.78,0:08:35.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is just too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.58,0:08:40.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry to be a bother!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.92,0:08:42.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.17,0:08:45.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know, the White Base\Nis leaving tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.80,0:08:46.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.17,0:08:49.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're having issues with\Nthe starboard engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.55,0:08:52.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If they took a hit in that spot,\Nthe ship would likely be stuck here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.18,0:08:54.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kai...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.56,0:08:56.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.02,0:09:01.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know how you feel, having to take care\Nof your younger brother and sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.61,0:09:05.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.36,0:09:11.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain.\NThere's a message from No. 107, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.70,0:09:14.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's in contact with\Na Trojan Horse crew member.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.16,0:09:17.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apparently, the Trojan Horse is having\Nproblems with its starboard engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.37,0:09:18.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.33,0:09:19.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.16,0:09:20.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.08,0:09:20.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.75,0:09:22.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Exactly where is No. 107 situated?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.29,0:09:24.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The same harbor as the Trojan Horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.46,0:09:26.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,While we attack with the Gogg...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.92,0:09:30.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...have No. 107 sneak aboard\Nthe Trojan Horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.05,0:09:31.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.80,0:09:34.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I would like to cover all possibilities.\NAll right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.85,0:09:35.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.72,0:09:38.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And if you do succeed,\NI will expedite your return to Zeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.18,0:09:40.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.73,0:09:44.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please return to the Mad Angler, Captain.\NI'll pull this one off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.69,0:09:47.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you. I am counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.53,0:09:54.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have the Mad Angler prepare for backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.66,0:09:55.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.66,0:09:58.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ship No. 2, launch Z'Gok!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.04,0:10:04.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everything's going smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.13,0:10:07.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This machine suits me much\Nbetter than the Gogg.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.80,0:10:12.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've lost response from Area 29.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.88,0:10:14.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A mobile suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.18,0:10:16.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unknown. It's faster than the previous ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.64,0:10:18.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell the crew to stand by to intercept!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.85,0:10:21.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take off at once?! It'll take us a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.35,0:10:23.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Send out the Guncannon and Guntank!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.73,0:10:26.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about the G-Fighter or G-Sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.90,0:10:27.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.82,0:10:30.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The voltage is a little irregular, but it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.40,0:10:31.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.65,0:10:34.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The enemy is using Freeze Gel\Nso you can't pursue them?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.82,0:10:37.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's our job to get past it and destroy them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.45,0:10:39.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire anti-submarine missiles!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.58,0:10:41.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Activate the harbor's defenses\Nand synchronize sonar!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.79,0:10:53.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We will begin our attack on the enemy\Nat the exact moment the Z'Gok reaches land.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.47,0:10:55.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Connolly, use that diversion to get to shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.72,0:10:57.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,CC2 received from Callahan\Nin the Z'Gok!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.60,0:11:01.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right! Launch the backup Gogg\Nand then surface!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.32,0:11:15.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Launch Connolly's boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.50,0:11:29.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is the dock's gate okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.96,0:11:34.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just break through it.\NIt'll be no problem with the armor on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.05,0:11:37.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Easy for you to say.\NHas the Guntank already left?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.05,0:11:39.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, no. The shaft isn't operating properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.89,0:11:40.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.15,0:11:51.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The repairs are done, so please get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.11,0:11:56.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!\NGundam taking off!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.12,0:12:02.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Sayla!\NThe Gundam will ride on top!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.58,0:12:03.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.60,0:12:31.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An air raid?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.23,0:12:36.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The White Base is being attacked?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.40,0:12:39.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It seems too soon{\i}\N{\i1}if Miharu informed Zeon herself.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.95,0:12:43.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where did your sister go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.66,0:12:45.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sh-She'll be back in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.49,0:12:47.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, she went shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.71,0:12:49.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmm... Did she really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.04,0:12:51.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh... It's the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.63,0:12:55.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll believe you.\NWhatever you say...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.88,0:12:58.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like they're attacking from the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.72,0:13:06.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gimme back my bicycle!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.10,0:13:07.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's for military use, you'll get it back later!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.90,0:13:13.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Greetings! Are you in a big hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.57,0:13:16.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? You're...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.53,0:13:18.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, no! No, I'm not in any hurry, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.32,0:13:21.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did you call me out to a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.36,0:13:24.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not used to this...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.28,0:13:26.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect someone like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.66,0:13:30.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here. There's money in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.66,0:13:34.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your orders are to infiltrate the Trojan Horse\Nand find out where they're heading to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.13,0:13:36.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.17,0:13:39.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Figure that out for yourself.\NJust sneak in by any means necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.26,0:13:41.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a lot here...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.76,0:13:43.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll do it, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.22,0:13:46.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hear there'll be more money in it\Nif you succeed. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.51,0:13:50.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In this bag you'll find\Na Federation Forces uniform...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.31,0:13:52.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...and the captain's letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.14,0:13:54.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understand. I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.23,0:13:56.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have to do something to feed my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.86,0:13:59.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's great. Well, I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.99,0:14:06.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.37,0:14:09.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Judging from the silhouette,\Nit looks like the Gundam and a fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.45,0:14:12.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell the forward Gogg to start attacking!\NPrepare for anti-air combat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.50,0:14:20.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Sayla! Please be careful!\NThere might be more than one ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.17,0:14:21.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.42,0:14:24.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll attack the closest submarine\Nwith the G-Fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.35,0:14:37.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.27,0:14:38.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Were you afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.77,0:14:40.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We were fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.40,0:14:41.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.49,0:14:44.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He took his stuff and left a while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.07,0:14:46.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did he say anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.70,0:14:49.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He said, "Best of luck."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.54,0:14:50.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.04,0:14:52.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Best of luck...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.71,0:14:55.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kai...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.21,0:14:57.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, listen, you two...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.29,0:15:00.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Big Sis has to go to work now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.67,0:15:03.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I could be gone for a bit longer\Nthis time, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.97,0:15:06.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Use this money carefully while I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.05,0:15:09.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Never tell anyone where the money is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.26,0:15:11.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.48,0:15:17.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I'm done with this job, let's go\Nsomeplace where there's no war, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.86,0:15:19.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All three of us...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.98,0:15:23.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have to be patient.\NI know how strong you two are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.49,0:15:25.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.45,0:15:32.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sis, you have the same nice smell\Njust like Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.58,0:15:37.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I made you remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.31,0:15:54.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A mobile suit is approaching\Nfrom the rear at 4 o'clock, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.48,0:15:57.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Hayato?!\NLaunch the Guncannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.52,0:16:00.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm leaving now! Is the beam rifle ready?!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.94,0:16:07.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hayato! Guncannon, launching!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.03,0:16:15.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's got nothing to do with me now.\NAll that shooting and exploding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.59,0:16:23.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C'mon! Now! Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.18,0:16:30.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This guy's too accurate with his shooting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.47,0:16:33.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So that's the infamous Gundam!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.10,0:16:37.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, it doesn't measure up to the rumors!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.15,0:16:47.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It doesn't concern me...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.36,0:16:49.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But... you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.28,0:16:50.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.57,0:16:54.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why am I worrying about\Nthe White Base after all those?!l
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.80,0:17:11.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Coward!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.93,0:17:13.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Coward!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.18,0:17:14.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Coward!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.81,0:17:19.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah... maybe I really am a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.11,0:17:25.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not the same trick again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.24,0:17:34.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Serves you right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.17,0:17:46.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Sayla! How's the battle going for you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.30,0:17:48.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amuro! Please return!!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.01,0:17:52.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A mobile suit is attacking Hayato's{\i}\N{\i1}Guncannon over at the harbor.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.43,0:17:54.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is Sayla in the G-Fighter.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.68,0:17:58.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've got an anti-submarine attack plane{\i}\N{\i1}backing me now. So I'm okay.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.07,0:18:19.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, those guys are so slow...\Nit's impossible for me to sit back and watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.66,0:18:22.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop! I'm with the military! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.67,0:18:27.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come to the base to pick it up later. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.52,0:18:50.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Guntank... where's the Guntank?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.53,0:19:01.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There it is! What's it doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.29,0:19:04.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mr. Kai! Please use it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.04,0:19:06.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We just finished the repairs on its shaft!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.21,0:19:07.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Hayato's in the cannon now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.96,0:19:10.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.59,0:19:15.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I... I'm not gonna let you get any closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.80,0:19:18.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's persistent. In that case...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.44,0:19:33.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll tear you apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.53,0:19:39.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh no! I've taken so much damage,\Nthere's no power left!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.37,0:19:44.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? A tank?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.50,0:19:47.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.46,0:19:57.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll lure the tank into the water\Nand take care of it out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.19,0:20:13.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've had it with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.78,0:20:22.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you wanna fight underwater\Nwhere you've got the advantage?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.23,0:20:58.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sayla here. I sank the enemy ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.74,0:21:02.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.08,0:21:09.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess this one is the real Gundam,\Nbut I'll finish it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.83,0:21:14.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.05,0:21:18.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You won't escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.72,0:21:23.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here he comes...!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.09,0:22:01.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The remaining ship has retreated!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.42,0:22:03.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! Check all sections!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.22,0:22:06.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As soon as we're done with\Nthe engine maintenance, we're taking off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.06,0:22:09.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.02,0:22:13.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, Amuro.\NI was told your toolbox isn't worth a dime.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.56,0:22:15.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that so...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.86,0:22:18.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello, Kai. Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.15,0:22:19.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hi, Ms. Sayla.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.48,0:22:22.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I couldn't stand watching you all struggle!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.11,0:22:24.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right, Hayato?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.28,0:22:25.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure, whatever you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.04,0:22:35.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like Spy No. 107\Nmade it on board the Trojan Horse...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.88,0:22:40.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However the enemy did manage to sink\None Gogg and one Z'Gok.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.34,0:22:42.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm. That sounds about right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.72,0:22:45.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's Boone's problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.47,0:22:48.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have him make arrangements\Nto contact our spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.89,0:22:49.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.64,0:22:55.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Later that night...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.52,0:22:58.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...the White Base left the demolished town...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.61,0:23:01.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...with a spy on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.83,0:23:20.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Char's relentless pursuit\Nshows no signs of letting up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.63,0:23:22.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As they face many dangers...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.42,0:23:26.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...Kai and Miharu's growing friendship\Ncomes to a tragic end.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.64,0:23:31.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who could possibly speak the words...\N"Miharu, rest in peace"?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.77,0:23:36.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mobile Suit Gundam. Next episode...\NAcross the Atlantic Ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.65,0:23:40.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will you be able to survive?
